{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06903","headline":"送陆擢 · 常建","name":"送陆擢","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"圣代多才俊，陆生何考盘。\n南山高松树，不合空摧残。\n九月湖上别，北风秋雨寒。\n殷勤叹孤凤，早食金琅玕。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"常建","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06903.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06903","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}